{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5761","title":"Xiaomi Foundation (Hong Kong) Donates HKD 10 Million in Emergency Relief for Tai Po Fire Response","desc":"The donation will be allocated to medical assistance for affected residents, emergency resettlement, and essential living support during the transition period.","view_cnt":"10546","like_cnt":"6","add_time":"1764214428","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/907_operatorx_operatorx_opx/27/11/2025/39c01c697720bccc97edf8d81fe3ce2e.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHong Kong, November 27, 2025\u003c/strong\u003e — Xiaomi Foundation (Hong Kong) has announced an emergency donation of HKD 10 million to support relief efforts following the Level 5 fire that broke out yesterday afternoon across multiple residential buildings in Wang Fuk Court, Tai Po, New Territories. The incident has caused significant damage, and rescue efforts are currently underway.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe donation will be allocated to medical assistance for affected residents, emergency resettlement, and essential living support during the transition period.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Foundation (Hong Kong) will continue to closely monitor relief efforts and work alongside partners across society to help residents overcome this difficult time and return to everyday life as soon as possible.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe extend our sincere gratitude to the relevant authorities and partner charitable organizations for their guidance and collaboration, and to all individuals who have offered their support. We also pay the highest tribute to the firefighters and all frontline personnel who have been steadfastly engaged in rescue and relief operations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/a\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience, and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2025, the MAU reached approximately 741.7 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 1,035.5 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index, and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2189","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1764214375"},"common":null}